<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink170-kilavi">
        talaimakaṉ kuṟivaḻicceṉṟu talaimakaḷaikkaṇṭapāṅkaṉ taṉṉuḷḷē colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
          Spoken by the hero to his own heart [when his] male friend saw the heroine on the path of [their earlier] tryst .</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink172">
<l>oṇṭoṭi yarivai koṇṭaṉa ṇeñcē</l>
<l>vaṇṭimir paṉittuṟait toṇṭi yāṅka</l>
<l>ṇuravuk kaṭalolit tiraiyeṉa</l>
<l>viravi ṉāṉun tuyilaṟi yēṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The young lady with bright bangles has taken my heart.</l>
        <l>Over there, in Toṇṭi with dewy ghats where bees hum,</l>
        <l>Like the waves with the sound of the strong ocean,</l>
        <l>I too know no sleep, although it is night.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
